{"sha": "04ba988f10070603bb3d89df1c829e27a2161bedf947f86ce24d991281f8c53b", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:heat-conduction} 章 --- 热传导}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:heat-conduction:1}", "$j = \\lambda\\Delta T/e = \\qty{80}{W/m^2}$；\\qty{8}{kW}；加羊毛后 $R = 0.25 + 2.5 =", "\\qty{2.75}{m^2.K/W}$：\\qty{7.3}{W/m^2}，\\qty{730}{W}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:heat-conduction:2}", "$a$：\\qty{1.2e-4}{m^2/s}，\\qty{7e-7}{m^2/s}，\\qty{1e-7}{m^2/s}。\\qty{1}{cm}：", "\\qty{0.9}{s}，\\qty{140}{s}，\\qty{1000}{s}；\\qty{20}{cm}：\\qty{6}{min}，\\qty{15}{h}，", "\\qty{5}{days}；地壳（$a \\sim \\qty{1e-6}{m^2/s}$）：$10^{15}\\,\\unit{s}$，", "三千万年。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:heat-conduction:3}", "单层：$R = 0.169$，$U = \\qty{5.9}{W/m^2/K}$，\\qty{118}{W/m^2}；双层：$R =", "0.63$，$U = \\qty{1.6}{W/m^2/K}$，\\qty{32}{W/m^2}。间隙中有对流，", "两层玻璃之间还通过辐射交换热量（约占实际传热的一半）；氩气的", "导热和对流都较弱，低发射率镀膜可抑制", "辐射。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:heat-conduction:4}", "取半厚度计算 $L^2/a$：\\qty{27}{min}；烤肉：$16\\times$，\\qty{7}{h}；", "$t \\propto L^2 \\propto m^{2/3}$：$\\times 1.6$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:heat-conduction:5}", "(a) $(rT')'/r = -p/\\lambda$，且 $T'(0) = 0$。(b) $p = j^2/\\gamma = \\qty{1.7e6}{W/m^3}$；", "$pR^2/4\\lambda = \\qty{1e-3}{K}$。(c) \\qty{625}{K}。(d) 导线近似等温；燃料", "芯块中心比表面高出数百开尔文 --- 反应堆的功率", "密度受燃料内热传导的限制。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:heat-conduction:6}", "(a) \\cref{prop:b2:heat-conduction:wave}。(b) \\qty{12}{cm}；\\qty{2.2}{m}。(c)", "$\\delta\\ln 10 = \\qty{5.2}{m}$；滞后 $2.3\\,\\unit{rad}$，$130$ 天。(d) 要使", "\\qty{20}{K} 的振幅须减半：$x = \\delta\\ln 2 = \\qty{1.5}{m}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:heat-conduction:7}", "(a) $\\mathrm{Bi} = hR/3\\lambda \\approx 10^{-4}$；$\\tau = \\rho cR/3h = \\qty{1100}{s}$。", "(b) $\\mathrm{Bi} = 1.2$：两种极限都不适用；内部时间 $R^2/a \\approx", "\\qty{6000}{s}$ 起主导作用。(c) $R$ 较小时，时间常数 $\\tau$ 很小，毕渥数也很小。", "(d) 占主导的膜层热阻 $1/h$ 减小。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:heat-conduction:8}", "(a) \\cref{prop:b2:heat-conduction:fin}。(b) $m = \\sqrt{2h/\\lambda t} =", "\\qty{13}{m^{-1}}$，$mL = 0.39$，$\\eta = 0.95$。(c) 面积 $\\times 2L/t = 60$，热流", "$\\times 57$。(d) 当 $mL \\approx 2$ 以后，多出的长度已处于", "流体温度；较薄的肋片 $m$ 更大，效率更低。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:heat-conduction:9}", "(a) \\cref{prop:b2:heat-conduction:resistance}。(b) 羊毛层 $\\ln 2/2\\pi\\lambda =", "\\qty{2.76}{K.m/W}$，外侧膜层 $1/2\\pi r_2h = 0.16$：\\qty{45}{W/m}；裸线时，", "$2\\pi r_1h\\Delta T = \\qty{410}{W/m}$。(c) $\\dd/\\dd r[\\ln(r/r_1)/2\\pi\\lambda + 1/2\\pi hr]", "= 0$ 在 $r = \\lambda/h$ 处成立。(d) $r_{\\text{c}} = \\qty{2}{cm} > \\qty{1}{mm}$：护套", "增加了散热损失 --- 它使铜线冷却了。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:heat-conduction:10}", "(a) $8000(1/273 - 1/293) = \\qty{2.0}{W/K}$。(b) $\\sigma_s = \\lambda T'^2/T^2$，其中", "$T' = \\qty{100}{K/m}$；$\\int\\sigma_s\\,\\dd x = \\lambda T'(1/T_{\\text{c}} - 1/T_{\\text{h}})", "= j(1/T_{\\text{c}} - 1/T_{\\text{h}})$；乘以 \\qty{100}{m^2}：结果相同。(c)", "\\qty{0.18}{W/K}。(d) $\\Phi(1 - T_{\\text{c}}/T_{\\text{h}}) = \\qty{550}{W}$；", "没有其他变化 --- 热量现在停留在 $T_{\\text{c}}$ 处（$T_{\\text{c}}\\dot S_{\\text{c}} = \\qty{550}{W}$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:heat-conduction:11}", "(a) $j_Q(0,t) = -\\lambda\\partial_xT = \\lambda\\theta_0\\sqrt2/\\delta\\,\\cos(\\omega t +", "\\pi/4) = \\sqrt{\\lambda\\rho c\\omega}\\,\\theta_0\\cos(\\omega t + \\pi/4)$。(b) 接触处两侧各自的热流", "为 $b_i|T_i - T_{\\text{c}}|/\\sqrt{\\pi t}$；令其相等：", "$T_{\\text{c}} = (b_1T_1 + b_2T_2)/(b_1 + b_2)$。(c) 铜为 \\qty{20.3}{\\celsius}，", "木头为 \\qty{29}{\\celsius}。(d) 瓷砖 $b \\approx 1500$，地毯 $\\approx 100$；", "该公式在两物体都可视为半无限大时成立；一旦热波前", "到达血液供应区和物体的另一侧，稳态", "就取决于实际供给的热量。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:heat-conduction:12}", "(a) 代入；$\\theta(\\pm L) = 0$ 给出 $\\cos k_nL = 0$。(b) $a_n =", "4\\theta_0(-1)^n/(2n+1)\\pi$；$\\theta = \\sum a_n\\cos(k_nx)\\eu^{-ak_n^2t}$。(c) $n = 0$，", "$\\tau = 4L^2/\\pi^2a$。(d) $\\tau = \\qty{650}{s}$；中心 $(4/\\pi)\\eu^{-t/\\tau} = 0.01$：", "$t = 4.8\\tau \\approx \\qty{52}{min}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:heat-conduction:1}", "\\textbf{1.} \\qty{0.25}{m^2.K/W}；\\qty{80}{W/m^2}。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $R = 0.415$，$U = \\qty{2.4}{W/m^2/K}$；加保温层后 $R = 2.9$，$U =", "\\qty{0.34}{W/m^2/K}$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} \\qty{5.9}{W/m^2/K}；\\qty{1.6}{W/m^2/K}。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $4800 + 2360 = \\qty{7.2}{kW}$；$680 + 640 = \\qty{1.3}{kW}$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $UA = \\qty{358}{W/K}$：$358 \\times 2500 \\times 86400 = \\qty{7.7e10}{J} =", "\\qty{21500}{kWh}$；之后为 \\qty{66}{W/K}：\\qty{4000}{kWh}。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $20 - 48/8 = \\qty{14}{\\celsius}$；$20 - 6.8/8 = \\qty{19.2}{\\celsius}$；", "冷墙向人体的辐射较少，并可能降到露点。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $a = \\qty{5.3e-7}{m^2/s}$；$e^2/a = \\qty{7.5e4}{s} \\approx \\qty{21}{h}$：墙体", "平均掉了白天的温度波动（日波动 $\\delta = \\qty{12}{cm}$ 小于", "墙体厚度）。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 设 $\\theta_0\\eu^{\\iu(\\omega t - \\underline kx)}$：$\\underline k = (1 - \\iu)/\\delta$。", ""]}